{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "493563a52d862b627c76b0fd65ae1f39de924d54e16634db666921417d9e4fea", "ja": "（ふう……。キリのいい所まで仕事も進んだし、\n少し休憩するかな。コーヒーでも淹れてこよう）", "zh": "（呼……工作正好告一段落，\n稍微休息一下好了，去泡个咖啡吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "fa32e5892cc239e65eeb07a0361f47f6ec814c05d283af4e3f225953df7ab669", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}くん！　ちょうど\nいい所に。いま会いに行こうと思ってたのよ～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n来得正好，我正打算去找你呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "2bd811483d8ffded7e8533dd872554c5d71fd47a616f71a28e0df0c62b40e62b", "ja": "ねえ、お腹すいてない？\n差し入れにケーキ買ってきたの♪", "zh": "欸，你会不会饿？\n我买了蛋糕来慰劳你喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8c75233cb067bf71d579b87d797c5f4042eed40b5a2331fd18d3847efadef072", "ja": "ああ、小腹がすいてきた所だったからありがたいよ。\nでも、急にどうしたんだ？　差し入れなんて。", "zh": "嗯，我肚子正好有点饿了，真是谢谢啊。\n不过，怎么这么突然？还准备吃的给我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "eecb84f07792d1c8b612b9f17928b7326c5d5eef588ad1e8318a3b071f915f2c", "ja": "ほら、この間のブライダルフェアで、私達だけ\n美味しいケーキを食べさせてもらったでしょ？", "zh": "你想想，之前婚纱展的时候，\n就我们几个吃了美味的蛋糕不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "29a9d90fe7bdbd811e63c24b7e3217cc04225fe11cdb712f2de09263810fcac0", "ja": "あの時、{$P$}くんが食べたそうに\nしてたの、お姉さんは気付いてたんだぞ～♪", "zh": "那个时候，{$P$}一副想吃的样子，\n大姊姊我可是有发现喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2e0036c33bcf3b0a1a8716a4d6a3cce8bebcd23a0165e91d82a9d7ae46db0599", "ja": "そんな目で見てたつもりはないんだけど……\nでも、それでわざわざ買って来てくれたのか？", "zh": "虽然我是不觉得自己有露出那种表情……\n不过，你就因为这样特地买了蛋糕过来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "770e98dd34201868dfbbcae9e9632fdbfd6d86e227eedf240b25aad2a7711cde", "ja": "そうよ？　まあ、私が自分で食べたかっただけ、\nっていうウワサもあるけど！　ウフフ♪", "zh": "对啊，不过也可能只是我自己想吃\n才找了个理由呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "2e8b303bf4bb0279238211611ba81c91fca588b2b2e437bb42b34cd5db338cac", "ja": "とにかく、もう買って来ちゃったんだし。\n遠慮しなくていいから、一緒に食べましょ♪", "zh": "总之，我都已经买来了，\n你就别跟我客气，一起吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "04e679f8ad07977cd9e53800252504f37a5d5a487cf7cdea4324ad50d3bd03dc", "ja": "はは、なるほどな。ありがたくいただくよ。\nありがとう、莉緒。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此，那我就心怀感激地开动了。\n谢谢你，莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "7c01f0cf0e242ebe5c30581ca6a5a7e1b0d26dd2a4b66e4479b0f92722b578f9", "ja": "どういたしまして♪　……あっ、そうだ！\nねえ、あ～んってしてあげよっか？", "zh": "不客气♪……啊，对了！\n欸，要不要我喂你啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fe481c59e3d523d64b9e0d5d17a970a8eb876ed605730bc6c269dc7c5c710f9e", "ja": "ええっ！？　\nいや、それは……遠慮しとくよ。", "zh": "什么！？\n呃不，你的好意……我心领了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "2a25480a791e5b82b67b06d765b4729866aaa39f758204730f4aa98e8276ac55", "ja": "あれ？　……もしかして照れてる～？　んもう、\n{$P$}くんってば、ウブなんだから♪", "zh": "奇怪？……难不成是害羞了～？唉唷，\n{$P$}真是的，好纯情喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fa956331b81be4ce2a18c9ed8402ef931616c6493fc5be30230500e7506a6e50", "ja": "そういう問題じゃないぞ！　そういうのは、その……\nプロデューサーとアイドルですることじゃないだろ？", "zh": "问题才不在这！这种事情……\n不是制作人跟偶像该做的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "b51b2b3aac73d7a80b9a3e7dfecf1d1456fe6bf729414272958684df53cecbdc", "ja": "え～、これくらいスキンシップのうちってコトで\nいいじゃない♪", "zh": "咦～这点小事当作是简单的肢体接触\n不就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "f1a7586cc9b733629f8f3455f48e6c4b42c63ffb0441044e59ce6b93f1cd0eb6", "ja": "結婚披露宴でも、みんなでやるんでしょ？\n大盛り上がりだって、スタッフの人も言ってたわよね？", "zh": "大家在婚宴上也会这么做不是吗？\n工作人员也说过这样可以炒热气氛对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c6f22234e645ac7544585836d6904701e35bfdd12644a9d2dffff4a83f186dc9", "ja": "ファーストバイトをやるのは新郎新婦だけだぞ？", "zh": "可是会分享第一口的就只有新郎新娘而已喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "2b9901265091e937828949bba360a9ede9534da29a0acb34255d4b7ca5def53d", "ja": "え？　新郎新婦……だけなの？", "zh": "咦？只有……新郎新娘而已？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e2b2b34da1c676befa33725dde37c8c8b4b6fb85fc2b0e23451b43d0e69fb322", "ja": "だけだよ。結婚したら、すべてをわかち合うっていう\n意味で。それも聞いたよな？", "zh": "没错，那象征着结婚以后，彼此将会共享一切。\n这你也有听到对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "ef996614b63ab8c5e6ce8096cb27317b49d0b505fbb532c90d9fdbf144916667", "ja": "…………、…………っ！", "zh": "…………唔…………唔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "b1fe4e5edd4b33adbf1d9de9337ff0821b9a4fd13368cb4616fe0cfe2b4afaa6", "ja": "な、なんだかアツいわね、この部屋！　あ～、ケーキが\n溶けちゃいそう！　私、ちょっと出直してくるわね～！", "zh": "这、这房间怎么感觉有点热啊！\n啊～蛋糕好像要融化了！我先离开一下，等等回来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0103_1021_p", "source_sha256": "fb47a979af228ace2f6a84137fc68a5e7023a2bbe1f5e76e68afc95cdec3c9e3", "ja": "えっ、ケーキを持っていくのか？\nそんなの、溶ける前に食べれば……おーい？", "zh": "咦？你连蛋糕也要拿走？\n只要在融化之前吃掉不就……喂～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
